# Comply repository

- Read root `AGENTS.md`; it is the canonical guide. For UI changes, also follow `.github/instructions/ui.instructions.md`.
- Use Node `26.5.0`, pnpm `12.8.1`, Java `21`, root pnpm scripts, and root `scripts/*.mjs`.
- `apps/ui` and `packages/*` are managed by pnpm/Turborepo. `apps/api` is Gradle project `:api`.
- Derive tenant scope from the authenticated `User` using `TenantAccessService`. Never trust a request organization ID for access control. Scope indirect reads, mutations, aggregates, exports, caches, and jobs; fail closed and test cross-organization access.
- API contract changes require coordinated Spring/OpenAPI, `packages/api-clients`, UI types/client, and contract test updates.
- Flyway history is append-only: add a new version; never modify, rename, or delete applied migration files.
- Write agent instructions, engineering docs, product UI, user-facing API messages and public Mintlify docs in clear, direct English. Keep internal identifiers and unsupported claims out of product copy.
- Preserve established accessibility, dense operational layouts, restrained colors, existing worktree changes, and generated Next.js instructions.
